  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Operationalisation of the Netherlands&#x2013;Bangladesh G2G PPP Platform</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This consultancy assignment aims to operationalise the Government-to-Government (G2G) Public-Private Partnership (PPP) Platform between the Netherlands and Bangladesh, building on prior PPP framework development and market exploration. It focuses on advancing structured, investor-ready PPP cases that align with Dutch strategic interests and Bangladesh&#x2019;s development priorities, particularly in water infrastructure financing and sustainable asset management. The project involves advisory support for the Joint PPP Platform, PPP structuring and bankability, formation of Dutch&#x2013;Bangladeshi consortia, strategic stakeholder engagement, and alignment with institutional capacity-building under the &#x201c;Flowing Forward&#x201d; programme. Key outcomes include enhanced PPP project bankability, strengthened consortia, improved investor confidence, and consolidation of lessons learned to inform post-2026 engagement.</narrative>
  </description>
